sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant App as RAG<br/>App
    participant DB as ChromaDB
    participant LLM as ChatOllama<br/>llama3.2

    Note over App,DB: Docs are already chunked<br/>and embedded into ChromaDB

    rect rgb(237,248,255)
        U->>App: Ask<br/>question
    end

    rect rgb(232,245,233)
        App->>DB: Retrieve top-k<br/>relevant chunks
        DB-->>App: Return chunks as<br/>context
    end

    rect rgb(252,241,244)
        App->>LLM: Prompt with<br/>context + question
        LLM-->>App: Answer using<br/>context only
    end

    rect rgb(232,234,246)
        App-->>U: Final answer<br/>or fallback message
    end